240	        "f_pp_cls",
241	        `CLS needs improvement at ${clsDisplay} (good: under 0.1)`,
242	        "warning",
243	        `Layout Shift score of ${clsDisplay} is in Google's 'Needs Improvement' range. Some elements shift during load — likely images missing explicit dimensions or fonts without font-display: swap.`,
