253	        "f_pp_cls",
254	        `CLS is excellent at ${clsDisplay} — layout is stable during load`,
255	        "passed",
256	        `Cumulative Layout Shift of ${clsDisplay} is in Google's 'Good' range (< 0.1). Page elements don't jump during load, preventing mis-clicks and frustration.`,
